# Rescuing Silas from the Guild (Milestone 20d, any other start). Plays on
# reaching Silas's rune after the Shadow Lord is beaten.

face player up
emote silas !
say Silas: The Shadow Lord, beaten? Huh. I had a plan for getting out of here, you know. It was a good plan.
say Silas: That thing used to be the guildmaster. Ran the best crew in the kingdom. Whatever Vorath did to it... it wasn't anyone I knew anymore.
say Silas: Frank sent you? Then there are more of us, and you'll need someone who can open a lock.
emote silas note
say Silas: Count me in. Point me at the next locked door.
join silas
despawn silas
sound level_up
narrate Silas joins the party!
set cleared_guild
